@baseUrl = http://localhost:40000
@username = admin
@password = admin

### Autenticacao (obter JWT)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/Login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "{{username}}",
  "senha": "{{password}}"
}

### Token retornado no login
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Listar contas a receber
GET {{baseUrl}}/getAllContasReceber HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Inserir conta a receber
POST {{baseUrl}}/insertContaReceber HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteid": 1,
  "descricao": "Fatura Referente ao Serviço X",
  "valor": 1500.50,
  "datavencimento": "2026-11-30",
  "recebido": false
}

### Buscar conta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/getContaReceberByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Atualizar conta a receber
PUT {{baseUrl}}/updateContaReceber/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteid": 1,
  "descricao": "Fatura Referente ao Serviço X (Atualizada)",
  "valor": 1600.00,
  "datavencimento": "2026-12-05",
  "recebido": true
}

### Excluir conta a receber
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/deleteContaReceber/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}